From 4c7d21656e58ac9eeb31a886e365ed24be5ebd9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: johnnylibretexts <264531926+johnnylibretexts@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:37:09 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 02/14] feat(a11y): add Remedy scan/preview/apply endpoints and
 bulk section updates
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds the server-side wiring the accessibility matrix needs to talk to a Remedy
Server instance, plus a bulk variant of the existing per-item update.

New endpoints, all behind verifyRequest + getUserAttributes and gated on
checkProjectMemberPermission:

  GET  /project/accessibility/remedy/health
  POST /project/accessibility/remedy/scan
  POST /project/accessibility/remedy/preview
  POST /project/accessibility/remedy/apply
  PUT  /project/accessibility/sections/items

The three Remedy routes proxy to /v1/cxone/page/{scan,preview-fix,apply-fix}.
The base URL comes from REMEDY_API_BASE_URL (or PROJECT_REMEDY_BASE_URL) and
defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8000; REMEDY_API_KEY, when set, is sent as
X-API-Key. Backend errors are unwrapped from the FastAPI `detail` shape so the
client sees the real reason rather than a generic failure.

Two constraints worth calling out for review:

- apply is refused unless the target page path contains a Sandboxes/ segment.
  Fixes write back to CXone, so the guard keeps writes off live library pages
  regardless of what the client sends.
- scan persists the returned wcagReview/dojExceptions onto the matching
  a11yReview subdocument, so a page's WCAG state survives a reload.

updateA11YReviewSectionItems replaces N sequential round-trips with one
bulkWrite when a reviewer toggles several cells at once; per-key validation is
unchanged (validateA11YReviewSectionItem, boolean values only).

importA11YSectionsFromTOC now uses the extracted TOC utils, so imported
sections carry pageID and merges preserve state across a retitle.

Also coerces a11yProgress to a number on update and validates it as a float in
0..100 — it is stored as Number and a string body value silently wrote a
string.

